<title>JAPAN: Japan to cancel July 24 wheat, barley tender.</title>
<headline>Japan to cancel July 24 wheat, barley tender.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Food Agency of Japan said on Thursday it will not carry out its weekly import tender for wheat and barley set for July 24, as it has finished buying all of its requirements for September shipment.</p>
<p>The agency will resume its grain import tender from July 31 for October shipment.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (+81-3-3432-7391)</p>
